    <item>
      <title>v0.4.0 - SaaS Frontend Architecture and CoinCompass Design System</title>
      <link>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.4.0</link>
      <description>Introduced CoinCompass design system in packages/ui with WebGL Aurora canvas and hatch overlay, trilingual elder consent, and RFC 9116 security.txt.</description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.4.0</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>v0.3.0 - Sprint 3: Speakerphone Resilience and Daily Credit Guards</title>
      <link>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.3.0</link>
      <description>Implemented client-side energy VAD gating in AudioWorklet, 30-min daily STT caps, and offline 8 kHz synthetic replay.</description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.3.0</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>v0.2.0 - Sprint 2: Multi-Tenant Guardian Auth and Emergency Intercom</title>
      <link>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.2.0</link>
      <description>Secured endpoints with random bearer tokens, implemented Push-to-Talk intercom, and 7-day transcript auto-purge.</description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.2.0</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>v0.1.0 - Sprint 1: Deterministic 5-Stage Detector and Contest Architecture</title>
      <link>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.1.0</link>
      <description>Created 5-stage extortion state machine, Gnani Prisma STT integration, and offline testbed.</description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://kavach.ai/changelog#v0.1.0</guid>
    </item>
